+From 1f3496053b13451bd992c3ca390edb4d39c5ffa2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Faith Ekstrand <faith.ekstrand@collabora.com>
+Date: Tue, 29 Jul 2025 03:10:41 -0400
+Subject: [PATCH] util: Move STACK_ARRAY into util
+
